rawn the gold set (decision 37): `POLICY.md`, then `eval/gold/split.json` and `HASH`, split from the training pool by the most inclusive grouping and a whole-text check, which `scripts/check_leakage.py` runs.","-- Next, 2C.2: label gold and dev by hand in `scripts/label_gold.py`'s page, before any model output, with a blind second pass on gold to measure agreement. Then freeze them. No label is made before the EM's review of 2C.1.","+**Phase 2C: the reader** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), on `phase-2c-reader`. Step 2C.1 designed and drew the gold set (decision 37). Step 2C.2 labelled all 300 gold and 150 dev articles by hand under `POLICY.md`, checked them with a blind second pass, ruled on every disagreement and froze the labels by sha256 in `HASH` (decision 38). No model has seen gold or dev.","+- Next, 2C.3 and 2C.4: the baselines, then teacher labels for the training pool, drawn from `split.json`'s pool with the stricter leakage recheck.","+- Evals read only `eval/gold/labels.jsonl` and `dev_labels.jsonl`, one label per article. `check_leakage.py` fails if either changes from its hash."," - Lexicon v2 keeps all five rules (decision 31)."," "," Needs the owner's yes when we get there:"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/RESUME.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a369317c-9f42-4e18-a5cf-5d4917303941","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2c-reader","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibi