{"parentUuid":"9484f8e5-6c46-4ea6-9bd9-51f074542aab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgaqhwx9gQXqwR3JQAp2t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pushed and confirmed on the remote: a8cb601 matches HEAD, and the tree is clean. Writing the hand-over note:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1621,"cache_read_input_tokens":685138,"output_tokens":1007,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1621,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1007,"cache_read_input_tokens":685138,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1621,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1621},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ee6b08e3-39de-4ad7-978e-6140a0a9aec2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgaqhwDk5kS8eLD4KE69F","requestRef":"9f9b86c4-ef5a-468a-90da-7e9c6734b10a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c527fd06-2dbc-4775-8f34-61920c3e1d71","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:08:14.769Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2c-reader","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"c527fd06-2dbc-4775-8f34-61920c3e1d71","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgaqhwx9gQXqwR3JQAp2t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015HxubxtwXfX1ZJzbeBHefW","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e/step-2C.2.md","content":"# Step 2C.2 hand-over: gold and dev labels (decision 38)\n\nBranch `phase-2c-reader`, head `a8cb601`, checked with `git ls-remote`. No PR yet; that waits for 2C to close.\n\n## What's frozen (`1e64421`)\n- `eval/gold/labels.jsonl`: 300 labels; `eval/gold/dev_labels.jsonl`: 150. One per article: the first pass's (labeller `Claude`) where the passes agreed, the ruling (labeller `ruling`) where they didn't.\n  - gold: 239 first-pass, 61 rulings\n  - dev: 142 first-pass, 8 rulings\n- All pass `checked()`, and each covers exactly its split (`uv run python scripts/second_pass.py frozen`).\n- `eval/gold/HASH` lists both files' sha256 beside `split.json`'s. `check_leakage.hashes_hold()` checks each one by name.\n- No model output has touched gold or dev.\n\n## Kept beside them, which evals must not read\n- `eval/gold/second_pass.jsonl`: 330 blind second-pass labels, all of gold and 30 seeded dev.\n- `eval/gold/adjudication.jsonl`: the 69 disputes, each with both labels, the ruling and the reason.\n\n## Results\n- `eval/results/phase2c/agreement.json`, before any ruling. Gold: kind 271/300 (κ 0.88, 0.84–0.92), report-or-not 296/300 (κ 0.95). On reports both passes call reports, people is the loosest field at 26/45.\n- `eval/results/phase2c/gold_measures.json`:\n  - 46 reports against 35.3 expected, with the per-stratum table in decision 38\n  - a weighted report rate of 0.97% (0.38–1.81%)\n  - the story-place rule at 31/34 (no wrong state; 3 misses), where the paper's state matches 2/10\n  - slice counts, with E9 for 159 articles\n\n## Notes for later steps\n- `POLICY.md` is now version 3: ordinary-sense spirit or medium is `other`, and a display notice is an `advert`.\n- The story-place rule misses states printed after a period (\"Allentown. Pa\") or apart from the place's quote. 2D's geocoding may want those two forms.\n- Seven reading agents hit a usage limit and were resumed in their own blind contexts. One saw two scratch folders' file names, but no contents.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1621,"cache_read_input_tokens":685138,"output_tokens":1007,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1621,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1007,"cache_read_input_tokens":685138,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1621,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1621},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_015HxubxtwXfX1ZJzbeBHefW":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e/step-2C.2.md","content":"# Step 2C.2 hand-over: gold and dev labels (decision 38)\n\nBranch `phase-2c-reader`, head `a8cb601`, checked with `git ls-remote`. No PR yet; that waits for 2C to close.\n\n## What's frozen (`1e64421`)\n- `eval/gold/labels.jsonl`: 300 labels; `eval/gold/dev_labels.jsonl`: 150. One per article: the first pass's (labeller `Claude`) where the passes agreed, the ruling (labeller `ruling`) where they didn't.\n  - gold: 239 first-pass, 61 rulings\n  - dev: 142 first-pass, 8 rulings\n- All pass `checked()`, and each covers exactly its split (`uv run python scripts/second_pass.py frozen`).\n- `eval/gold/HASH` lists both files' sha256 beside `split.json`'s. `check_leakage.hashes_hold()` checks each one by name.\n- No model output has touched gold or dev.\n\n## Kept beside them, which evals must not read\n- `eval/gold/second_pass.jsonl`: 330 blind second-pass labels, all of gold and 30 seeded dev.\n- `eval/gold/adjudication.jsonl`: the 69 disputes, each with both labels, the ruling and the reason.\n\n## Results\n- `eval/results/phase2c/agreement.json`, before any ruling. Gold: kind 271/300 (κ 0.88, 0.84–0.92), report-or-not 296/300 (κ 0.95). On reports both passes call reports, people is the loosest field at 26/45.\n- `eval/results/phase2c/gold_measures.json`:\n  - 46 reports against 35.3 expected, with the per-stratum table in decision 38\n  - a weighted report rate of 0.97% (0.38–1.81%)\n  - the story-place rule at 31/34 (no wrong state; 3 misses), where the paper's state matches 2/10\n  - slice counts, with E9 for 159 articles\n\n## Notes for later steps\n- `POLICY.md` is now version 3: ordinary-sense spirit or medium is `other`, and a display notice is an `advert`.\n- The story-place rule misses states printed after a period (\"Allentown. Pa\") or apart from the place's quote. 2D's geocoding may want those two forms.\n- Seven reading agents hit a usage limit and were resumed in their own blind contexts. One saw two scratch folders' file names, but no contents.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ee6b08e3-39de-4ad7-978e-6140a0a9aec2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgaqhwDk5kS8eLD4KE69F","requestRef":"9f9b86c4-ef5a-468a-90da-7e9c6734b10a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bde227b1-db67-4199-b086-30c597fbb2ac","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:08:23.031Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","vers