{"parentUuid":"6ce8425d-47cd-4bcf-ad2c-f2f579a0aba9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bc78905f-f97a-4964-afea-9b791531d532","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rmjo7SovYJv2VJnGkMp5Tz","type":"tool_result","content":"891:**38. Gold and dev are labelled by hand under `POLICY.md`, all 450 through the page's `checked()`. A blind second pass relabels all of gold and a seeded fifth of dev. On gold it agrees with the first pass on 271 of 300 kinds (κ 0.88, 0.84–0.92) and on 296 of 300 report-or-not calls (κ 0.95). Every one of the 69 disagreements is ruled on under `POLICY.md`, both labels kept, and the labels are frozen by sha256 before any model output. Gold holds 46 reports, against the 35.3 expected.**\n905:  - Each saw only its packet, the crops it lists, and `POLICY.md`: no first label, stratum, weight or split. Each was barred from the label files, the split, the results, the docs and git history. One reported listing two scratch folders by mistake and seeing only file names.\n931:- **The rulings** (`eval/gold/adjudication.jsonl`): 69 articles disagreed, 61 of them in gold. 34 were on kind, and 35 on fields alone.\n943:  - **`POLICY.md` version 3,** dated, adds the two clarifications the rulings settled, which every label already follows. Spirit or medium in an ordinary sense is `other` (rule 10), and a display notice of meetings and messages is an advert (rule 12).\n944:- **The freeze** (`1e64421`):\n948:  - Gold's final kinds: 46 reports, 89 other, 66 fiction, 60 idiom, 30 adverts, 9 religious. Dev's: 32 reports, 44 other, 31 fiction, 26 idiom, 10 adverts, 7 religious.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3fe039c3-fd13-4e38-a00b-897af903f6f4","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:17:10.156Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"891:**38. Gold and dev are labelled by hand under `POLICY.md`, all 450 through the page's `checked()`. A blind second pass relabels all of gold and a seeded fifth of dev. On gold it agrees with the first pass on 271 of 300 kinds (κ 