he mumps \"knocking\" is `other`, since it isn't a ghost figure","     - the Russian-news ouija simile is an `idiom`","     - an amusements column with seats on sale is an advert","-  - The 24 field changes are mostly people: the blind rulings drop a person told of it afterwards and add a stated claimant, such as an editor who claims spirit control.","+  - The other 24 changes are to fields, mostly people: the blind rulings drop a person told of it afterwards and add a stated claimant, such as an editor who claims spirit control.","   - **Rule 10's clarification, checked:** on the 17 other-versus-idiom disputes, the judges would rule `other` on 15 even without v3's bullet, and they call the bullet right in all 17. The two exceptions: \"bold spirits\", which they rule `other` under the bullet, and the obituary's \"spirit land\", kept as above.","   - **Final, all 69:** kinds side with the first pass in 27 and the second in 7. Gold still holds 46 reports."," - **The freeze** (`1e64421`, re-frozen after the blind re-ruling):"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"43b0ce1c-7c4c-46db-8a86-01facc81ebe9","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2c-reader","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":7,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Pap