{"parentUuid":"d2926509-7b1c-4321-bd93-2e9d0ae2afb6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgasSJSy6FPakdoG8tmPU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019e3dgVGmM5ixJNePWF1fnZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad; cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && git diff --cached > $S/staged-cc.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-cc.diff; echo \"host hits: $(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-cc.diff)\"; git status --short; git commit -q -m \"2C.3 so far: the credit check, the teacher on dev, the draw and its check\n\n- The credit check measures 50 seeded pool candidates. The teacher costs\n  \\$0.0076-0.0290 an article and 4B reading \\$0.00026-0.00038. The full pass\n  of 1,236,122 projects to \\$323-470, and all of 2C to about \\$400-620\n  (BUDGET.md). Tinker reports no balance, so the owner has to read it in\n  the console.\n- The teacher (Qwen3.5-397B, POLICY.md in its prompt, prompt sha256 on\n  every answer) on all 150 dev articles in two rounds: kind 112-114/150\n  and report-or-not 139/150. Round 2's worked JSON example lifts place,\n  outcome, place type and precision to 14-18 of 24.\n- The quote verifier, calibrated on dev, sits at 0.70: no other\n  article's quote passes, and it rejects 2.2% of the teacher's values.\n  A failed value is dropped.\n- The training draw takes gold's allocation scaled, one printing per\n  story, from the pool. Its check adds the stricter 4-run, 0.05 reprint\n  rule, and passes on a provisional draw. Its size waits on the balance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q origin phase-2c-reader 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; git log --oneline -1; git rev-parse HEAD; git ls-remote origin refs/heads/phase-2c-reader","d