tcome, place type and precision to 14-18 of 24.\n- The quote verifier, calibrated on dev, sits at 0.70: no other\n  article's quote passes, and it rejects 2.2% of the teacher's values.\n  A failed value is dropped.\n- The training draw takes gold's allocation scaled, one printing per\n  story, from the pool. Its check adds the stricter 4-run, 0.05 reprint\n  rule, and passes on a provisional draw. Its size waits on the balance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q origin phase-2c-reader 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; git log --oneline -1; git rev-parse HEAD; git ls-remote origin refs/heads/phase-2c-reader","description":"Scan, commit and push 2C.3's progress, then check the remote"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"80ce819b-fdbf-4f45-ac9a-29c2a437c2b4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgasSHXuekFNKgaBegXqa","requestRef":"5668e993-1fc6-4c2e-bade-d9229d23426d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d334352c-fe2f-4f2b-a660-604129e2df18","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:31:03.558Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2c-reader","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
