{"parentUuid":"c2683a16-e44e-4791-93b8-73f1ea677a62","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgasUg5ng2UYwzwHHE3Yw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pushed and confirmed on the remote (e2d9200). Writing the hand-over note:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_read_input_tokens":827031,"output_tokens":1215,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":36},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1215,"cache_read_input_tokens":827031,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fddd721a-bc5d-4853-805f-1fb4780be4c1","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgasUf6FbPQ7LXDEGdBw1","requestRef":"51396b1f-a9cf-4d4a-a5f9-7bf2c368d364","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c71ef11c-4b7b-4c37-a8db-b59500920d67","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:31:29.003Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2c-reader","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"c71ef11c-4b7b-4c37-a8db-b59500920d67","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgasUg5ng2UYwzwHHE3Yw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R4QWtf6N3FB7nenwH2gKnU","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e/step-2C.3.md","content":"# Step 2C.3 hand-over (blocked on the Tinker balance)\n\nBranch `phase-2c-reader`, head `e2d9200`, checked with `git ls-remote`.\n\n## The decision 38 fix: the blind re-ruling, done at `35e8a53`\n- Four fresh judges ruled all 69 disputes blind: A and B by a seeded coin, no labeller names or notes, no label files.\n- Against the first labeller's rulings: kind 28/34 (66–92%). Fields lean the second pass's way, people 4/19.\n- 30 differing articles were re-read: the blind ruling was taken in 28, and mine kept in 2 for consistency with undisputed labels.\n- Labels were re-frozen (`HASH`), `gold_measures.json` re-run, and decision 38 amended. Gold still holds 46 reports.\n- Rule 10's v3 bullet: on the 17 other-vs-idiom disputes, the judges would rule `other` on 15 even without it, and called it right in all 17.\n\n## 2C.3 so far\n- **Credit check** (`credit_check.json`, `Docs/BUDGET.md`):\n  - teacher $0.0076–0.029 an article, 4B reading $0.00026–0.00038\n  - the full pass $323–470, all of 2C about $400–620\n  - Tinker exposes no balance, so **the owner has to read it in the console**\n- **Teacher on dev** (`teacher_dev_r1.json`, `_r2.json`):\n  - kind 112/150, report-or-not 139/150 (κ 0.77)\n  - round 2's fields after verification: place 17/24, outcome 14, place type 18, precision 18, seen 7, people 6\n- **Verifier:** calibrated on dev at 0.70. 0% of cross-article quotes pass, and it rejects 2.2% of the teacher's values.\n- **Training draw:** `scripts/training_draw.py`, gold's allocation scaled, one printing per story. Its check, with the stricter 4-run, 0.05 rule, passes on a provisional 3,000, which wasn't committed.\n\n## Not done, waiting on the balance\n- the draw's final size and its teacher labels (`data/teacher/`, with sha256)\n- the hand-check of 40 teacher labels\n- the skip rule's measured loss, if the pass doesn't fit\n\n## Notes\n- SRS RDR-9 says to calibrate the verifier on gold. The EM said dev, which is what was done, and RDR-9 should be amended.\n- Seen and people stay weak for the teacher. A third prompt round should target them.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_read_input_tokens":827031,"output_tokens":1215,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":36},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1215,"cache_read_input_tokens":827031,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01R4QWtf6N3FB7nenwH2gKnU":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e/step-2C.3.md","content":"# Step 2C.3 hand-over (blocked on the Tinker balance)\n\nBranch `phase-2c-reader`, head `e2d9200`, checked with `git ls-remote`.\n\n## The decision 38 fix: the blind re-ruling, done at `35e8a53`\n- Four fresh judges ruled all 69 disputes blind: A and B by a seeded coin, no labeller names or notes, no label files.\n- Against the first labeller's rulings: kind 28/34 (66–92%). Fields lean the second pass's way, people 4/19.\n- 30 differing articles were re-read: the blind ruling was taken in 28, and mine kept in 2 for consistency with undisputed labels.\n- Labels were re-frozen (`HASH`), `gold_measures.json` re-run, and decision 38 amended. Gold still holds 46 reports.\n- Rule 10's v3 bullet: on the 17 other-vs-idiom disputes, the judges would rule `other` on 15 even without it, and called it right in all 17.\n\n## 2C.3 so far\n- **Credit check** (`credit_check.json`, `Docs/BUDGET.md`):\n  - teacher $0.0076–0.029 an article, 4B reading $0.00026–0.00038\n  - the full pass $323–470, all of 2C about $400–620\n  - Tinker exposes no balance, so **the owner has to read it in the console**\n- **Teacher on dev** (`teacher_dev_r1.json`, `_r2.json`):\n  - kind 112/150, report-or-not 139/150 (κ 0.77)\n  - round 2's fields after verification: place 17/24, outcome 14, place type 18, precision 18, seen 7, people 6\n- **Verifier:** calibrated on dev at 0.70. 0% of cross-article quotes pass, and it rejects 2.2% of the teacher's values.\n- **Training draw:** `scripts/training_draw.py`, gold's allocation scaled, one printing per story. Its check, with the stricter 4-run, 0.05 rule, passes on a provisional 3,000, which wasn't committed.\n\n## Not done, waiting on the balance\n- the draw's final size and its teacher labels (`data/teacher/`, with sha256)\n- the hand-check of 40 teacher labels\n- the skip rule's measured loss, if the pass doesn't fit\n\n## Notes\n- SRS RDR-9 says to calibrate the verifier on gold. The EM said dev, which is what was done, and RDR-9 should be amended.\n- Seen and people stay weak for the teacher. A third prompt round should target them.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"fddd721a-bc5d-4853-805f-1fb4780be4c1","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgasUf6FbPQ7LXDEGdBw1","requestRef":"51396b1f-a9cf-4d4a-a5f9-7bf2c368d364","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ff9945b-bba6-4116-8ec1-fec693030046","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:31:37.465Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","use