{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","id":"a1145009-2493-407f-af4a-490b9c61a87c","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:31:39.432Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"7b35af0d1ba22d1b1b7d4c91038d50b583ea5d544dd1607adac5368903cb8a35","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"51396b1f-a9cf-4d4a-a5f9-7bf2c368d364","keep":526,"tail":["664f7d311b7d55052fb597c861770e54b62c7470bec7a6b8d12cae5cc3f7b856","0ff7c3178ebedeb840cbecaaf4b1fdae28d767e87dab001a199c84b51e447044"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",527,"content",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"efd9ab2930d614ae3b7374e66c9b079beaf92038c1429585a1ffa2e995387f4d"}
{"parentUuid":"5c46a272-2999-47be-aead-7ec65a892ef4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgasVhCXjpmjLESdGnD67","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2C.3: BLOCKED — Tinker doesn't expose the credit balance (only the console shows it). The full pass projects to $323–470 and all of 2C to about $400–620, so I've done no bulk spend.\n\n**The independent re-ruling (decision 38's fix), done at 35e8a53 before any model output:**\n- Four fresh judges re-ruled all 69 disputes blind. Each saw the two labels as A and B by a seeded coin, with no names or notes and no label files.\n- On kind they matched my rulings on 28 of 34 (66–92%). On fields they sided with the second pass two to one, and on people four to one, so my field rulings had leaned toward my own labels.\n- I re-read all 30 articles where they differed. I took their ruling in 28 and kept mine in 2, each for consistency with labels nobody disputed.\n- Four kinds changed. Gold still holds 46 reports.\n- `HASH` is re-frozen, `gold_measures.json` re-run and decision 38 amended. The story-place rule now agrees on 29 of 32 places. Decision 38 also says the agent that saw scratch-folder file names is fine.\n- **Rule 10:** on the 17 other-vs-idiom disputes, the judges would rule `other` on 15 even without the v3 bullet, and called it right in all 17. So I didn't need to bring it to you.\n\n**2C.3 so far, at e2d9200, pushed and checked with `ls-remote`. Tests (390) and lint pass.**\n- **Credit check (`Docs/BUDGET.md`):** measured on 50 seeded candidates. The teacher costs $0.008–0.029 an article and 4B reading $0.00026–0.00038; billing hasn't caught up yet, so these are tokens times billing's rates.\n- **Teacher on dev, two prompt rounds:**\n  - Kind is right on 112 of 150 and report-or-not on 139 of 150 (κ 0.77).\n  - After verification, place type and precision are right on 18 of 24 each, place on 17 and outcome on 14. Seen (7) and people (6) are still weak.\n- **Verifier:** the threshold is 0.70, calibrated on dev. No quote from another article passes, and it rejects 2.2% of the teacher's values. SRS RDR-9 says to calibrate on gold and should be amended to match.\n- **Training draw:** it takes gold's allocation scaled, one printing per story. Its check with the stricter 4-run, 0.05 rule passes on a provisional 3,000, which I didn't commit.\n\n**Needed from the owner:** the Tinker balance from the console. Once I have it, I'll:\n- size the draw\n- run the teacher on it and store the labels with their sha256\n- hand-check 40 of them\n- measure the skip rule's loss, but only if the full pass doesn't fit\n\nThe hand-over note is `step-2C.3.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1423,"cache_read_input_tokens":828272,"output_tokens":965,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1423,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":965,"cache_read_input_tokens":828272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1423,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1423},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"aeab1786-a78c-41ab-a615-4b5fbabfc132","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgasVgHU2164US8mtpZzt","requestRef":"a1145009-2493-407f-af4a-490b9c61a87c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"29a6d201-943a-4d94-abca-408e8029a3d3","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:31:49.645Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Use