{"parentUuid":"f353047f-05f9-401b-ada4-788c4e768b99","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"99a9efcd-226c-4aca-a2b3-32bc2d8dcd3e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0112D754PXNjFLdkbzumgkXN","type":"tool_result","content":"\"\"\"Base Qwen3.5-4B's local throughput on this Mac (2C.3): the free path for the full pass.\n\nThe credit check's seeded 50 candidates, with the student's instructions and the same hand-rendered\nChatML, go to the local Ollama server one at a time and then several at once. Ollama runs\nits MLX runner for this model (nvfp4 weights), can load a LoRA adapter, and is already on this\nMac (phase 1). Its model is the\nlibrary's default quantization, so any accuracy difference from Tinker's weights is measured on\ndev in the plan's step 9, not here. Writes eval/results/phase2c/local_throughput.json.\n\"\"\"\n[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: scripts/local_throughput.py. Call Read before editing.]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"efa94900-5195-40e1-b863-41051f75e4f1","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:39:20.934Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"\"\"\"Base Qwen3.5-4B's local throughput on this Mac (2C.3): the free path for the full pass.\n\nThe credit check's seeded 50 candidates, with the student's instructions and the same hand-rendered\nChatML, go to the local Ollama server one at a time and then several at once. Ollama runs\nits MLX runner for this model (nvfp4 weights), can load a LoRA adapter, and is already on this\nMac (phase 1). Its model is the\nlibrary's default quantization, so any accuracy difference from Tinker's weights is measured on\ndev in the plan's step 9, not here. Writes eval/results/phase2c/local_throughput.json.\n\"\"\"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"staleReadFileStateHint":"[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: scripts/local_throughput.py. Call Read before editing.]","bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Co