{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","hash":"0ea9d1f44e8a548ae3f6844ab17032b329790a417cddb471a7fa14fc355dee4b","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The owner's pivot replaces 2C.3, so I'll park it as committed and build the submission. That also settles the Ollama question: no restart."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01491xzEtrMfXUD6GwgUZe5d","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"items":[{"content":"Park 2C.3 and cut the submission branch","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Delegate the numbers sheet to a subagent","status":"pending"},{"content":"Export reports.json from the frozen labels","status":"pending"},{"content":"Build the Morgue static demo in web/","status":"pending"},{"content":"Verify build, lint, tests; push; report demo ready","status":"pending"},{"content":"Live reading demo on 3 dev reports","status":"pending"},{"content":"README for judges","status":"pending"},{"content":"Release hygiene: history scan and log redaction","status":"pending"}],"scope":"new_task"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Tg24d5TdLAqbBzMTCF24Cx","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e","summary":"Tell the EM about the owner's pivot","message":"The owner pivoted, so I'm not restarting Ollama. Via the session \"btw: My mac is stucking\" (local_cbd6aed2): Week 4 is submitted tonight, and 2C.3 is parked as committed.\n- The owner's session had already stopped Ollama on purpose because the Mac was freezing. I'm following its rule: no Ollama or mlx-lm except one read_one demo run, alone, with num_ctx 4096.\n- I'm building the static Morgue demo and the numbers sheet on a new branch, `submission`, then the live demo, the README and release hygiene."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016weGzyzzXh2u7dt7mpLG5K","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Document