oup of two or more.\n  - E1 and E13 are too thin to measure alone.\n- **The grouping missed one reprint within gold:** the comic sketch of a backwoods preacher is printed twice in gold. Two printings within gold don't leak into training, and both are labelled `fiction\n22:def at(rel: str, path: str = \"\", *fields) -> tuple:\n32:def number(text: str):\n38:def doc(rel: str, pattern: str) -> tuple:\n46:def row(name: str, got: tuple, note: str = \"\") -> dict:\n52:def spend() -> list:\n76:def kinds(split: str) -> tuple:\n82:def teacher(round_name: str, label: str) -> list:\n104:def formats() -> list:\n123:def entries() -> list:\n131:        \"Docs/DECISIONS.md\",\n428:def main() -> None:\n82:## How many stories fit with full text\n121:## Options for the owner\n134:## What Tinker reports\n151:## Per article, measured\n158:## The projection\n174:## The free path: the full pass on this Mac\n194:## Spend stopped (2026-10-31): no Tinker spend, and 2C runs locally (decision 39)\n197:- **Today's Tinker use,** from each run's recorded tokens (billing hadn't caught up when the spend stopped):","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5147d419-817f-4303-9645-6c2cf8bb0de7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"submission","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Pa