{"parentUuid":"ba59a12c-19a4-4e7a-947d-989daafeed9c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb5PMhViWrauu3WSWyCb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019uT81RPxQJTWdjmNQ7Cptk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && uv run ruff format scripts/export_demo.py && git add scripts/export_demo.py && nice -n 10 make lint >$S/lint.log 2>&1 && nice -n 10 make test >$S/test.log 2>&1 && git diff --cached > $S/staged-e.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-e.diff && test \"$(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-e.diff)\" = 0 && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git push -q origin submission 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; tail -1 $S/test.log; git ls-remote origin submission; git rev-parse HEAD\nClear scans first, the paper's place, decision 39, and a Render file\n\nThe Morgue now leads with the reports whose OCR reads best, by the share\nof their words in a dictionary. A headline the OCR garbled gets a plain\ntitle (the story's place and \"a ghost report\"), with the scanned\nheadline beneath; the text itself is never rewritten. Each report says\nwhere its paper was printed, from its cached title record or the place\nits LoC title gives, labelled as the paper's place and never the\nstory's, and can be filtered by that state. Decision 39 records the\nowner's local-only call, the spend stopped and the teacher comparison so\nfar. render.yaml builds the static site for the owner to deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF","description":"Format, then gate, commit and push again"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":337392,"output_tokens":800,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":42},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":800,"cache_read_input_tokens":337392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019uT81RPxQJTWdjmNQ7Cptk":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && uv run ruff format scripts/export_demo.py && git add scripts/export_demo.py && nice -n 10 make lint >$S/lint.log 2>&1 && nice -n 10 make test >$S/test.log 2>&1 && git diff --cached > $S/staged-e.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-e.diff && test \"$(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-e.diff)\" = 0 && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git push -q origin submission 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; tail -1 $S/test.log; git ls-remote origin submission; git rev-parse HEAD\nClear scans first, the paper's place, decision 39, and a Render file\n\nThe Morgue now leads with the reports whose OCR reads best, by the share\nof their words in a dictionary. A headline the OCR garbled gets a plain\ntitle (the story's place and \"a ghost report\"), with the scanned\nheadline beneath; the text itself is never rewritten. Each report says\nwhere its paper was printed, from its cached title record or the place\nits LoC title gives, labelled as the paper's place and never the\nstory's, and can be filtered by that state. Decision 39 records 