{"parentUuid":"0ed24a9e-e93d-4b4a-a1b8-745394004ec5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb6248MsBUgjMKAWU8Bd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SfWRxVtB43MX7TGWkJNDb9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && git add web/public/brand web/index.html web/src Docs/BRAND.md scripts/check_contrast.py tests/test_check_contrast.py && nice -n 10 make lint >$S/lint.log 2>&1 && nice -n 10 make test >$S/test.log 2>&1 && git diff --cached -- . ':(exclude)*.png' ':(exclude)*.jpg' > $S/staged-b.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-b.diff && test \"$(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-b.diff)\" = 0 && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git push -q origin submission 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; tail -1 $S/test.log; tail -2 $S/lint.log; git ls-remote origin submission; git rev-parse HEAD\nThe brand: a hand-drawn mark, favicons, a social card and BRAND.md\n\nThe mark is a newspaper page that is itself the ghost: its torn hem is a\nghost's, with hollow eyes and an open mouth in its columns, drawn by\nhand as SVG in full colour and in one colour, and rendered for favicons\nat 16 to 512 px and a 1200x630 social card. It heads the masthead.\nDocs/BRAND.md sets the name, tokens, type and voice, and\nscripts/check_contrast.py checks all 20 text pairings against WCAG AA\nfrom the CSS itself (5.17 to 15.15), kept by a test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF","description":"Gate, commit and push the brand step"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2050,"cache_read_input_tokens":380151,"output_tokens":846,"o