{"parentUuid":"c5b936af-3731-46d4-87e6-c55ce01ad36d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb6MKsvJ2796CsVDRzJr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X2vzzGWJGSiSqEUEJDyqXL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"date +%H:%M; cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && git add web/src web/public/reports.json web/public/numbers.json scripts/export_like.py scripts/export_demo.py scripts/article_numbers.py eval/results/numbers.json && nice -n 10 make lint >$S/lint.log 2>&1 && nice -n 10 make test >$S/test.log 2>&1 && git diff --cached > $S/staged-u.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-u.diff && test \"$(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-u.diff)\" = 0 && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git push -q origin submission 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; tail -1 $S/test.log; tail -2 $S/lint.log; git ls-remote origin submission; git rev-parse HEAD\nThe Morgue's rooms: How we know, Paper samples, ghosts like this one\n\nHow we know reads every figure from the numbers sheet, copied into the\nsite, and charts each measure with its Wilson interval: the archive\nscreen, reprint chaining, the gold set's two passes, and the teacher\nbenchmark of the 397B on Tinker against gemma4 on this Mac, with the\nformat-against-judgment finding, the price per 10,000 articles and the\nspend stop. Paper samples shows the clearest scan for each outcome,\ncaptioned only with its verified quotes. Each case lists the five ghosts\nlike it that Atlas Search's moreLikeThis ranks closest\n(scripts/export_like.py), so the static build stays offline. A place\nthat already names its state no longer takes it twice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF","description":"Gate, commit and push the new pages"}