{"parentUuid":"0918631e-bc71-4111-b342-78160b17f149","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb6k2z53AF2eeqMLjEDJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WWqc94TobANYtmZXPBezZZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && git add README.md web/src/App.tsx Docs/demo && nice -n 10 make lint >$S/lint.log 2>&1 && nice -n 10 make test >$S/test.log 2>&1 && git diff --cached -- . ':(exclude)*.jpg' > $S/staged-r2.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-r2.diff && test \"$(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-r2.diff)\" = 0 && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git push -q origin submission 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; tail -1 $S/test.log; git ls-remote origin submission; git rev-parse HEAD\nThe README's rooms, Atlas and disclosure; screenshots; Entire's trail\n\nThe README now shows the mark, the Morgue's three rooms, the Atlas\ncommands, the AI disclosure and the brand. Docs/demo/screenshots holds\nevery page in both lights at desktop and true phone width (390 px), and\nDocs/demo/entire_sessions.md points to two recorded sessions, the reprint\nchaining fix and the blind re-ruling, with what must be redacted before\neither is published. A linked report is now shown alone, with a link\nback to all of them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF","description":"Gate, commit and push the README, screenshots and Entire note"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":208,"cache_read_input_tokens":432839,"output_tokens":742,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetc