{"parentUuid":"0b2159a5-9f7b-4bd3-a910-6162cd8ce988","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb6tdnoPD8aVFnQkm1m7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing changes: Ollama stays off, and gemma4's recorded dev outputs remain the proof that open models do the reading, as the published work already says.\n\nI'm taking direction only from the kickoff session ([Paperghosts Hacktoberfest week 4 kickoff](#local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e)) from now on. The owner's session's answer of running the live demo at a 12,288 context is withdrawn.\n\nThe `submission` branch is still at 383742b. I'm waiting for the owner's decision on the Entire redaction, which will come through the kickoff session. Until then I won't touch Entire's saved sessions."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1663,"cache_read_input_tokens":438713,"output_tokens":301,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":80},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1663,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":301,"cache_read_input_tokens":438713,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1663},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"52288c14-43d2-4740-91f1-f5dadd12700c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgb6tcvDn9uivVZDtCfD8","requestRef":"1581edcc-e174-4b9c-8551-64536b82e1b3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5d5681e0-0ddf-4f32-8946-22f168684152","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:27:24.358Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","u