{"parentUuid":"f879fe50-7e6d-492b-b266-0166692807fd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgbDiGRTfozZ5TaV3WCvz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ALcuaHKbp9Tk2LvqeG26Z2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && u=$(ls /Users | grep -v -E \"^(Shared|hotragn|Guest|\\..*)$\") && git add scripts/load_demo_places.py eval/results/atlas_places.json Docs/demo/atlas_near.txt && nice -n 10 make lint >$S/lint.log 2>&1 && nice -n 10 make test >$S/test.log 2>&1 && git diff --cached > $S/staged-g.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-g.diff && test \"$(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-g.diff)\" = 0 && git commit -q -m \"Near this town: the papers' towns geocoded into Atlas, found by \\$geoNear\n\nscripts/load_demo_places.py geocodes the 46 towns the Morgue's papers\nwere printed in from the GeoNames dumps already in data/geonames, all 46\nfound, and upserts them into paperghosts.places with report counts and\nyears, labelled as where the papers were printed, never where a story\nhappened. Its near mode runs \\$geoNear on the collection's 2dsphere index:\nthree printed-in towns within 250 km of Philadelphia, eleven within 600\nkm of Kansas City, about half a second each (Docs/demo/atlas_near.txt).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && cp=$(git log -1 --format='%(trailers:key=Entire-Checkpoint,valueonly)') && r=refs/entire/checkpoints/${cp: -2}/$cp && n=$(git grep -c -F \"$u\" $r 2>/dev/null | awk -F: '{s+=$NF} END {print s+0}') && echo \"checkpoint name hits $n\" && test \"$n\" = 0 && git push -q origin submission 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; tail -1 $S/test.log; git ls-remote origin submission; git rev-parse HEAD","descript