{"parentUuid":"f8fabff8-a33a-4d4c-82cb-f3c1cfacccf0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgbDwE89xUgPc3H6FQPuw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MEwLUDGz7ezd9xskE25fQv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && u=$(ls /Users | grep -v -E \"^(Shared|hotragn|Guest|\\..*)$\") && git add web/public/brand web/src/index.css Docs/BRAND.md Docs/demo && nice -n 10 make lint >$S/lint.log 2>&1 && nice -n 10 make test >$S/test.log 2>&1 && git diff --cached -- . ':(exclude)*.png' ':(exclude)*.jpg' > $S/staged-l.diff && uv run python $S/scan_staged.py .env $S/staged-l.diff && test \"$(grep -c -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" $S/staged-l.diff)\" = 0 && git commit -q -m \"A scarier mark for Halloween, and the phone nav on one row\n\nThe page-ghost now has a ragged torn hem, narrow slanted eye slits and a\njagged mouth cut through its columns, and a dark shadow, and still reads\nat 16 px. The first mark is kept as logo-v1.svg, and\nDocs/demo/logo-before-after.jpg shows both at 16, 64 and 512 px. The\nfavicons, the social card and all 16 screenshots are redrawn from it. On\na phone the three room links now stay on one row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && cp=$(git log -1 --format='%(trailers:key=Entire-Checkpoint,valueonly)') && r=refs/entire/checkpoints/${cp: -2}/$cp && n=$(git grep -c -F \"$u\" $r 2>/dev/null | awk -F: '{s+=$NF} END {print s+0}') && echo \"checkpoint name hits $n\" && test \"$n\" = 0 && git push -q origin submission 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; tail -1 $S/test.log; git ls-remote origin submission; git rev-parse HEAD","description":"Gate, commit and push the new mark, nav and screenshots"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"sto