{"parentUuid":"326e8ae9-20ff-4a92-b5d2-4b035cbbed1f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgbHQJ8N9FRNJwcSiqT8c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`main` has phases 1 through 2B merged. `submission` adds 75 commits: phase 2C's work so far, parked, plus the whole submission. Opening the PR from `submission` into `main`, without merging:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":624990,"output_tokens":1459,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":107},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1459,"cache_read_input_tokens":624990,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4352f73f-04be-48ba-a0fe-e1fc51b7d98b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgbHQHfLVfWJKK4i9FQsx","requestRef":"d42e4345-fc75-4b08-8812-77fc7dc78b2a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d93aaa4e-c6f8-418c-a28a-a36071320fac","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:45:13.050Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"submission","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"d93aaa4e-c6f8-418c-a28a-a36071320fac","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgbHQJ8N9FRNJwcSiqT8c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WLdESHufKswxATre5NFq8J","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && cat > $S/pr.md <<'EOF'\n## What this is\n\nThe Week 4 submission, \"Ghost in the Machine\", together with phase 2C's work so far. Phase 2C (the reader) is parked as committed, per decision 39.\n\n**The Morgue** is a static site holding the 78 labelled ghost reports, and it works offline (`web/`).\n- Its rooms: the drawer, with search and filters; each report with its clipping beside its marked transcription; Paper samples; and How we know, with every figure and its interval.\n- It passes axe with 0 violations on every page in both lights, and works at phone width.\n- `render.yaml` deploys it as a static site, with no keys in the bundle.\n\n**The numbers:** `scripts/article_numbers.py` writes `eval/results/numbers.json`, every figure with its source.\n\n**MongoDB Atlas:**\n- the 78 reports as schema-validated `Report` documents\n- fuzzy Atlas Search (\"apparition\" finds the OCR's \"apparilion\")\n- `moreLikeThis` for ghosts like this one\n- `$geoNear` over the 46 towns the papers were printed in, geocoded from GeoNames\n\n**Sentry:**\n- every Atlas query is traced (`db.atlas.query`)\n- releases are commits, and the web app has tracing with source maps\n- decision 40's fix: a repeat \"ghosts like\" request went from 110 to 61 ms\n\n**Entire:**\n- the 121 checkpoints that held another local account's process list are redacted; the owner ran the leased force-push, and 0 hits remain\n- a private rule pack keeps new checkpoints clean\n- `Docs/demo/entire_sessions.md` covers the two picked sessions and their token use\n\n**Phase 2C:**\n- the teacher benchmark: the 397B on Tinker against gemma4 on this laptop\n- the format-against-judgment check\n- the spend stop and the local-only rules (decisions 39 and 40)\n- the local runs' resume fixes\n\n**Brand:** the hand-drawn mark, menacing for Halloween, plus `Docs/BRAND.md` and a WCAG AA contrast check.\n\n**The post draft:** `Docs/POST.md`, for the owner to publish.\n\n## Checks\n\n- 404 tests, lint (ruff, oxlint, tsc) and the web build pass.\n- A secret scan of all history, including every Entire checkpoint, found no keys, no hostname, and no trace of the other account.\n- `.env`, `Docs/IDEAS.md` and the Entire backup are ignored.\n\n## Not in it\n\n- **Atlas Vector Search:** the index is built, but Hugging Face's inference credits ran out (HTTP 402), and the owner chose to spend nothing.\n- **The trained reader** is future work.\n- **No Sentry agent spans:** no model calls ran after tracing was added.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head submission --title \"Week 4 submission: the Morgue, Atlas, Sentry and Entire, and phase 2C so far\" --body-file $S/pr.md 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" | tail -2","description":"Open the PR from submission into main"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":624990,"output_tokens":1459,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":107},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1459,"cache_read_input_tokens":624990,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WLdESHufKswxATre5NFq8J":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && S=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad && cat > $S/pr.md <<'EOF'\n## What this is\n\nThe Week 4 submission, \"Ghost in the Machine\", together with phase 2C's work so far. Phase 2C (the reader) is parked as committed, per decision 39.\n\n**The Morgue** is a static site holding the 78 labelled ghost reports, and it works offline (`web/`).\n- Its rooms: the drawer, with search and filters; each report with its clipping beside its marked transcription; Paper samples; and How we know, with every figure and its interval.\n- It passes axe with 0 violations on every page in both lights, and works at phone width.\n- `render.yaml` deploys it as a static site, with no keys in the bundle.\n\n**The numbers:** `scripts/article_numbers.py` writes `eval/results/numbers.json`, every figure with its source.\n\n**MongoDB Atlas:**\n- the 78 reports as schema-validated `Report` documents\n- fuzzy Atlas Search (\"apparition\" finds the OCR's \"apparilion\")\n- `moreLikeThis` for ghosts like this one\n- `$geoNear` over the 46 towns the papers were printed in, geocoded from GeoNames\n\n**Sentry:**\n- every Atlas query is traced (`db.atlas.query`)\n- releases are commits, and the web app has tracing with source maps\n- decision 40's fix: a repeat \"ghosts like\" request went from 110 to 61 ms\n\n**Entire:**\n- the 121 checkpoints that held another local account's process list are redacted; the owner ran the leased force-push, and 0 hits remain\n- a private rule pack keeps new checkpoints clean\n- `Docs/demo/entire_sessions.md` covers the two picked sessions and their token use\n\n**Phase 2C:**\n- the teacher benchmark: the 397B on Tinker against gemma4 on this laptop\n- the format-against-judgment check\n- the spend stop and the local-only rules (decisions 39 and 40)\n- the local runs' resume fixes\n\n**Brand:** the hand-drawn mark, menacing for Halloween, plus `Docs/BRAND.md` and a WCAG AA contrast check.\n\n**The post draft:** `Docs/POST.md`, for the owner to publish.\n\n## Checks\n\n- 404 tests, lint (ruff, oxlint, tsc) and the web build pass.\n- A secret scan of all history, including every Entire checkpoint, found no keys, no hostname, and no trace of the other account.\n- `.env`, `Docs/IDEAS.md` and the Entire backup are ignored.\n\n## Not in it\n\n- **Atlas Vector Search:** the index is built, but Hugging Face's inference credits ran out (HTTP 402), and the owner chose to spend nothing.\n- **The trained reader** is future work.\n- **No Sentry agent spans:** no model calls ran after tracing was added.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head submission --title \"Week 4 submission: the Morgue, Atlas, Sentry and Entire, and phase 2C so far\" --body-file $S/pr.md 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" | tail -2","description":"Open the PR from submission into main"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"4352f73f-04be-48ba-a0fe-e1fc51b7d98b","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgbHQHfLVfWJKK4i9FQsx","requestRef":"d42e4345-fc75-4b08-8812-77fc7dc78b2a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9e5fbb36-bca2-48ac-9c70-1addbada546d","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:45:24.304Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"submission","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
