{"parentUuid":"3f1419f4-b4b8-4818-85a7-b55810149068","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgbJ2u6Jo7AsErmxF9eSy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The three fixes are in [Hotragn/Paperghosts#6](https://github.com/Hotragn/Paperghosts/pull/6), on a new `post-fixes` branch cut from `main` at 5cc7d7e. The PR is mergeable and not merged. All 404 tests, lint and the build pass, and the secret scan found nothing in the change.\n\n1. **Whose answers ran where:** the post now says \"gemma4's dev answers were produced on this laptop through Ollama\", so it no longer suggests the 397B's answers were local too.\n2. **Entire's token figures:** the numbers sheet now reads both sessions' figures from `Docs/demo/entire_sessions.md`. That's 59,983,120 tokens over 73 calls for the reprint-chaining fix, and 26,688,512 over 34 for the blind re-ruling.\n3. **Día de los Muertos:** two sentences after the opening tie the theme to the real people in these reports, named by their own papers. They are Detective John Burnside, who caught the Springfield gang, and Miss Parsons, the parish clerk's twelve-year-old daughter at Cock Lane. I checked both against their reports' text first.\n\nI've stopped there. Making the repo public, deploying on Render and publishing the post are yours to do."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":192,"cache_read_input_tokens":645002,"output_tokens":425,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":192,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":425,"cache_read_input_tokens":645002,"cache_creation_input_tokens":192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":192},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"95a5201c-1677-4d69-8612-50881a9de0b2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgbJ2t9ktuWjcUAnVWkxw","requestRef":"fc446a58-9950-4a0a-a24e-5827c23fd902","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"d89b950d-03c7-49b8-b01d-ca412680b9ac","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:53:31.196Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"post-fixes","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
