{"parentUuid":"3bdc7421-7678-4167-900a-1f6667d3bc96","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgbm7wyj6SCdmGYwLRJ8d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XGqzGVturvugUYQNZs4Eet","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && B=https://github.com/Hotragn/Paperghosts/blob/onboarding-motion/Docs/demo/screenshots && gh pr create --base main --head onboarding-motion --title \"The Morgue's first visit: a note, one real report, and a little motion\" --body-file - <<EOF\nA smoother first visit and some quiet motion, as the EM asked. Decision 41 in \\`Docs/DECISIONS.md\\` has the full account.\n\n## Onboarding\n- **A note above the request slip:** what a morgue is, the count and span from \\`reports.json\\`, and the 1879 Springfield magic-lantern hoax as one real envelope with its two verified quotes. It has one button, **Read this report**, and one line per room.\n- **A hint in an opened report,** shown once: what the marked words and \"Not stated\" mean.\n- **An empty search** suggests apparition, haunted or knocking (8, 14 and 2 reports), or clearing the slip.\n- Each note can be put away, and that's remembered in \\`localStorage\\` inside try/catch. Putting the note away moves focus to the search box. There's no tour library and no modal.\n\n## Motion\n- **Lenis** for the wheel only. Anchors, the skip link, the hash routes, focus and the keyboard stay the browser's.\n- **React Bits,** copied into \\`web/src/bits/\\` with its MIT + Commons Clause notice, the code unchanged:\n  - SplitText: the tagline's words blur in.\n  - FadeContent: the featured envelope and the paper samples develop like a print.\n  - Noise: a still paper grain at 0 fps.\n- No WebGL, and nothing that redraws every frame. The drawer's envelopes don't animate, so search and filter are as they were.\n- **Reduced motion:** no Lenis, a plain tagline, content shown at once, and the GSAP chunk never fetched.\n\n## Bundle\n| | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Main JS | 241.35 kB (75.76 gzip) | 270.32 kB (84.84 gzip) |\n| GSAP chunk, motion visitors only, after first paint | none | 132.92 kB (52.38 gzip) |\n| CSS | 21.62 kB (4.92 gzip) | 24.21 kB (5.57 gzip) |\n\n## Checks\n- \\`make lint\\` (ruff, oxlint, tsc) clean, \\`make test\\` 404 passed, \\`pnpm --dir web build\\` clean.\n- axe: 0 violations on 5 views × 2 lights × desktop and phone × motion and reduced motion.\n- In headless Chrome with real frames:\n  - The skip link is the first Tab stop.\n  - Lenis wheel scrolling works.\n  - \\`#drawer\\`, the rooms nav, the button, the hint, the suggestions and the put-away all work, and they survive a reload.\n- Secret scan of the diff and its Entire checkpoint: no keys, 0 hostname hits, 0 other-account hits.\n\n## First view, before and after\n| | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Desktop, lights on | ![]($B/first-desktop-light-before.jpg) | ![]($B/first-desktop-light-after.jpg) |\n| Desktop, lights off | ![]($B/first-desktop-dark-before.jpg) | ![]($B/first-desktop-dark-after.jpg) |\n| Phone, lights on | ![]($B/first-phone-light-before.jpg) | ![]($B/first-phone-light-after.jpg) |\n| Phone, lights off | ![]($B/first-phone-dark-before.jpg) | ![]($B/first-phone-dark-after.jpg) |\n\nNot merged and not deployed: that's for the EM.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":374,"cache_read_input_tokens":211863,"output_tokens":1371,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":374,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1371,"cache_read_input_toke